// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Gossamer 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Fortunata Gossamer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1629289620" "Fortunata Gossamer"
// ProfessionString :
"P1048321443" "Rogue Arachnos Fortunata"
// DescriptionString :
"P605241696" "Fortunata Gossamer was one of the first women assigned to help Marshal Blitz in Warburg. Originally, she was merely there to ensure that no heroes attempted to psychically control Bltiz or the governor. However, Gossamer believed in Marshal Blitz's goals and helped him take over Warburg.<br><br>Gossamer's faith in Marshal Blitz is rock solid; some members of the Rogue Arachnos say that Gossamer thinks she is the next 'Red Widow', the woman who originally helped Lord Recluse get into power."
// LocationString :
"P3437209096" "St. Martial"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3586582455" "<color orange>You need to purchase the third episode of first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, in order to play this story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2756450677" "Good to meet you, {HeroName}. I am Fortunata Gossamer. You can just call me Gossamer, as I'm technically not apart of <i>Arachnos</i>. You see, I serve under <color yellow>Marshal Blitz</color>, the leader of the Rogue Arachnos in <color yellow>Warburg</color>. To make a long story short, Blitz is leading his own group of Rogue Arachnos to glory and towards the destruction of Paragon City.<br><br>We've heard a lot about your abilities, {HeroName}, and we would like your help in our next big plan. If all goes according to plan, <i>you</i> will become infamous, <i>feared</i> throughout Paragon City, and the Rogue Arachnos shall show that they are a new world super power. Are you interested?"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P4288133471" "Sorry, dear, presently I have no operations suited for your threat level. Return when you have reached at least 30."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3377107435" "Come now. Organize yourselves, my pets. I would only speak with an appointed leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2071330249" "Bring your team to me, {HeroName}, and then we'll delve into the shadowy world behind superhuman political affairs."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1482946817" "I sense that one of your team is unable to handle this operation with the care and discretion it deserves."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P4130927701" "Marshal Blitz is waiting for our next move."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


