// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : SigArc1M5Contact 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : "Leo Poggiani" 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4073839430" "Leo Poggiani"
// ProfessionString :
"P620889730" "Mook Capo"
// DescriptionString :
"P1234098306" "Leo Poggiani is one of the capos for the Mooks in Port Oakes. In the grand scheme of things, the Mooks don't have a terrible amount of power. However, when it comes to matters in Port Oakes, the Mooks know everything that happens. Well, almost everything."
// LocationString :
"P3345659944" "Port Oakes"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P1285491121" "<color orange>You need to purchase the fourth episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, in order to play this story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2834236245" "Yo, {HeroName}, thanks for swinging on by. You uh, got the message, yeah? Well, if you didn't, and you're just here talking, here's the thing. I know you're way above us mooks over here in Port Oakes, and that's fine. With that whole business that went down in Warburg, you're a few years ahead of us.<br><br>Now, here's the thing. We heard about your other partner, Wade. I know he's got a place around here in the Oakes, just don't know where.<br><br>Word on the street is there's big trouble stirring up in little Oakes, if you get my drift, trouble by the name of Back Alley Brawler. He's looking to try to dismantle this entire operation, you know? Now, if you wanna take care of this, I can tell you everything you need to know, provided  that when you do your whole full rise to power, you remember this conversation, eh?<br><br><color orange>This arc contains elite bosses, which may be difficult to defeat by yourself.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1594795931" "I ain't got time to talk to you, especially since you're not even threat level 40."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1923219236" "I gotta talk to whoever is leading your band of villains, buddy."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3063952833" "Everyone's gotta be here in Port Oakes before we get going."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P167687716" "Someone in your group doesn't have the chops for this."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P2539009777" "Are we gonna keep this thing going?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


