// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : SigArc1M6Contact 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Protector Z-958 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P511328400" "Protector Z-958"
// ProfessionString :
"P1401111179" "Paragon Protector"
// DescriptionString :
"P3048964660" "Protector Z-958 is one of many Paragon Protectors 'employed' by Crey. Z-958 is extremely sensitive to psychics, which would explain why the portion of Aurora Borealis trapped inside of Psyche's mind has decided to communicate through him. Aurora's time is short, however; there's no telling when Crey is going to lock down the control she has over Z-958."
// LocationString :
"P3340683840" "Grandville"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P303764858" "<color orange>You need to purchase the sixth episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, in order to play this story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P4100805195" "<color orange>Protector Z-958's head slumps downward, then snaps back up.</color><br><br>{HeroName}! It is Aurora Borealis. The one that's within Sister Psyche's mind. I remember all that you did to help me escape.<br><br>I need your help once more. If you can do this one last thing, I will be truly free, and I promise you that I shall pay you back ten-fold!<br><br>You can walk away, but <i>please</i>, you must help me. I am going to <i>die</i>, this time for good!<br><br><color orange>This arc contains elite bosses, which may be difficult to defeat by yourself.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2718299058" "<color orange>Protector Z-958 stares at you silently.</color>Apologies, villain, but Crey does not allow me to do business with anyone beneath threat level 40."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3061374401" "<color orange>Protector Z-958's head slumps downward, then snaps back up.</color><br><br>You! Wait... you're not the leader of your group. Please, I need to speak with your group's leader!"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P4254907727" "<color orange>Protector Z-958's head slumps downward, then snaps back up.</color><br><br>{HeroName}! Everyone needs to be gathered here before we can begin, hurry!"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P4054250652" "<color orange>Protector Z-958's head slumps downward, then snaps back up.</color><br><br>{HeroName}! Someone in your group is not powerful enough to handle this."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P2118493112" "We have precious little time, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


