// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Tyrkis 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tyrka 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4132384412" "Tyrka"
// ProfessionString :
"P1444518354" "Former Circle Mage"
// DescriptionString :
"P3379422715" "Tyrka is a former Circle of Thorns mage. There aren't many members of the Circle of Thorns who willingly abandon thousands of years of tradition, but Tyrka seems to have been swayed enough by someone to leave the Circle of Thorns. It's assumed from the body that Tyrka's spirit is a female, though Tyrka has never confirmed that suggestion."
// LocationString :
// InteractionRequiresText :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2104018152" "Hello. {HeroName}. I am Tyrka. Darrin Wade has requested I speak with you. I've heard much about what you've done in the past, and I wish to help you achieve more in the present and future.<br><br>Your own plans and Mr. Wade's are falling in line nicely with each other. As you're no doubt aware, Malaise has been arrested by the authorities of Paragon. This odd behavior is exactly what we need; it is now time for us to take action and make an attack on Sister Psyche.<br><br>Of course, many have fought the psychic before, but this time it will be different. We will be going inside of her very <i>mind</i> to attack her. Out of formality, I must ask, are you interested in truly destroying one of the most powerful psychics in the world?<br><br><color orange>This arc contains elite bosses and may be difficult to complete by yourself.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P343629344" "Sorry, my dear {HeroName}, but this task requires you to be at least threat level 30."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P980315434" "Please, I'll need to speak with the leader of your group to handle this."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P4188311771" "Your entire group needs to be in St. Martial in order for us to begin."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1235463377" "There's someone on your team who is too weak to handle this, unfortunately."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P1464186699" "We must hurry if our plans are to succeed."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


