// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vladimir Zolner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3631098898" "Vladimir Zolner"
// ProfessionString :
"P138995740" "Ex-Spetsnaz"
// DescriptionString :
"P884180995" "Vladimir Zolner was supposedly a former member of Vympel, a division of the Spetsnaz that specializes in counter-terrorist activities. People in the Isles say that he deserted the group in order to seek his own fortunes within the Isles. Some whisper that he may be placed here by the Vympel to keep tabs on Arachnos; others insist he is on the run from the group, claiming to have seen him engaged in several fire fights with his former allies."
// LocationString :
"P607884113" "Sharkhead Isle"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2275899381" "<color orange>You need to purchase the second episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, or be a VIP in order to play this story arc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3388074363" "{HeroName}. My name is Vladimir Zolner. I am contacting you on this day to develop working relationship. Allow me to explain, if you will.<br><br>I am known as man who has much information about goings-ons in Rogue Isles. There is group that decided to come to me for information regarding <color yellow>Midnighter Club</color>, organization known for their magic experience. Group that came to me called themselves <color yellow>Rulu-Shin</color>. They are cultists who seek destruction of world by releasing omnipotent entity called Rularuu.<br><br>I refused to give them information on how to enter Midnighter Club, so group destroyed my home and took information on how to get in there.<br><br>Now you see why we are talking at this moment. I want to suggest you and I work together. Rulu-Shin intend to steal everything from Midnighters; I suggest <i>you</i> steal from Rulu-Shin <i>and</i> Midnighters. I get petty satisfaction and revenge, you get lots of magic artifacts. What do you say?"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P4029041790" "You need to be at least threat level 20 to be any use to me."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2183009174" "During time in Spetsnaz, we always insist that leader of squad handle issues. That is same right now, tell your leader to come speak to me."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1406948217" "All of your squad must be gathered here if we are to begin."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1480516822" "Person on your squad is not strong enough to handle what we are going to be up against."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P3860204902" "We will make weird cultists pay, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

